02:29.042 --> 02:33.303
We're not an anchor and a sail We're just a ship

02:33.363 --> 02:37.844
that will prevail We are the compass, we are the

02:37.884 --> 02:45.506
map We're finding our way back

02:45.546 --> 02:50.707
Cause you were never meant to stay You were the

02:50.847 --> 02:58.791
sail Meant to fly But I was never a heavy stone You

02:58.871 --> 03:06.416
never had to be alone I'm not the anchor You're

03:06.476 --> 03:13.580
not the sail We're in this storm and we will

03:13.620 --> 03:13.921
prevail

03:25.972 --> 03:32.394
We will prevail

03:32.414 --> 03:38.316
We're coming home

03:38.336 --> 03:41.477
We're coming home

